version: "0.1.1"
abstract: "Computer-assisted proof candidate that R_3(ax+3y=3z) = a^3+a^2+7a+1 for all integers a >= 4 with 3 not dividing a (case b=3 of Conjecture 1.1 of Ahmed, Zaman and Bright). Not peer reviewed."
keywords: ["Rado numbers", "Ramsey theory", "SAT", "LRAT", "computer-assisted proof"]
